{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">香港電訊上半年純利按年增加百分之4。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">至21.5億元，每單位中期分派34.8仙，增加近百分之3。期內，收入186.8億元，升幅百分之7.8。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-30T00:18:10.680865+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":70,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}